{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gastownhall/bdp/pulls/139","id":4882390300,"node_id":"PR_kwDOUHbQ5s8AAAABIwNdHA","html_url":"https://github.com/gastownhall/bdp/pull/139","diff_url":"https://github.com/gastownhall/bdp/pull/139.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/gastownhall/bdp/pull/139.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gastownhall/bdp/issues/139","number":139,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Implement durable Transactional authorization revocation","user":{"login":"donnabox","id":520275,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMDI3NQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/520275?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/donnabox","html_url":"https://github.com/donnabox","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donnabox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donnabox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donnabox/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donnabox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donnabox/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donnabox/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donnabox/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donnabox/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donnabox/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Persist a private authorization-policy transition from all-visible, writable access to an empty view with mutations disabled. The transition drains admitted mutations within a bounded administrative deadline, publishes a new durable view, and revokes old stream delivery leases. Current reads and receipt pages project the new policy; old-view checkpoints, Snapshots, and continuations retain their view errors. Durable Event identity is preserved across the transition.\n\nThis is a Scope-wide private transition, not per-resource or per-principal ACL support. Public profile admission remains unchanged.\n\nValidation covers11 distinct source cases,22HTTP exchanges, rollback/reopen, projected receipt schemas, HEAD, stale handles and queued delivery. The coherent old-policy control fails only its intended assertion. Fresh archives and an external consumer passed the18-request visibility and4-request active-Event witnesses at the original clean integration. The first external observer attempt failed resolving AJV before a product child or request; its corrected external dependency anchor and both outcomes are retained.\n\nCI first exposed stale assumptions in two existing fixtures; their repair passed both complete files (114tests). The next CI passed all9,334tests (one skip,183files) and7preflight cases, then exposed four missing entries in the strict packed-output inventory. Those explicit entries are now included without weakening equality, export or test-support checks. Syntax, formatting and complete isolated smoke pass locally. Both failed CI attempts remain recorded; fresh exact-head CI is still required before merge.\n\nThe feature scope is18files: the15-file implementation/tests, two compatibility-fixture repairs and one four-line smoke inventory update. Neither follow-up repair changes production or installed payload bytes.\n","created_at":"2026-10-16T02:06:10Z","updated_at":"2026-10-16T03:01:52Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"515f8fcf00284cf1f3e7dc088b760480bdb7c42f","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gastownhall/bdp/pulls/139/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gastownhall/bdp/pulls/139/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gastownhall/bdp/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gastownhall/bdp/issues/139/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gastownhall/bdp/statuses/27b4f963c88067419a95f677fa8d7b